<title>USA: Phar-Mor Q3 shr profit nil vs profit $0.13.</title>
<headline>Phar-Mor Q3 shr profit nil vs profit $0.13.</headline>
<dateline>YOUNGSTOWN, Ohio 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Net shr	   $0.00		    $0.13</p>
<p> Net		 49			 1,544</p>
<p>	  39 Weeks ended Mar. 29		Mar. 30</p>
<p> Net shr (loss)  $0.22	 (profit) $0.49</p>
<p> Net (loss)	2,694	 (profit) 6,014</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: The company's thirteen week quarters ended March 29, 1997 and March 30, 1996.</p>
<p>The company said expenses associated with the proposed business combination with ShopKo Stores Inc reduced its net income during the quarter.</p>
<p>The company said total sales for the 13 weeks ended March 29, 1997 were $264 million versus $252 million for the comparable thirteen weeks of the prior year.</p>
<p>The company said comparable store sales for the 102 stores it operated during the third quarter of fiscal 1997 were $262 million versus $252 million for the prior period.</p>
